# The results first making the player the leader (spec M6): the test game without weapons, its
# player one point behind the leader and the leader of the standings with 30 points fewer, so
# that only a win makes the player lead (--save 0:captures/leader-turn.sg; `leader_turn_save`
# in crates/headless/tests/menu_run.rs makes the same file), into the easy race as in
# lap.scenario, the car driven four laps to win it (--drive along captures/path4.txt:
# lap.scenario's path and three more laps of it from its point 131), Return held on the race's
# end box (which looks at the keys held), then on each results page; the last one's way out
# fades every colour, ENDANI0.HAF plays, then the shop, and Return on its way on. A few shots of
# the race, one every 500 ms on the results, then every 200 ms from the way out; run with
# --no-ai --drive captures/path4.txt:185:3594 --rand 50:3129847534.
